other's murder  which in turn affects his own timeline  and causes major chaos Michael Keaton's  appearance is Batman which has long been  confirmed will no doubt be one of the  highlights of the upcoming film time  will tell with the movie and its events  mean for the dceu moving forward either  way we should be eager to find out  whether post-production will go smoothly  from here on the flash is expected to  hit theaters on June 23 2023  the world's most famous movie  archaeologist will soon be making his  comeback after 15 years Harrison Ford  now 80 will use his Whip and put on his  hat for the very last time as Indiana  Jones we can therefore look forward to a  grand finale to the movie series The  Plot revolves around Indy going back in  time to be exact to New York in the year  1969. there he has to deal with Nazis  once again which presumably have their  hands in the iconic moon landing program  mads Mickelson will play the main  antagonist of the movie a character  named valer we are pretty intrigued for  the film's release on June 30th 2023  foreign  any other film series is as renowned for  its well done action and daring stunts  as Mission Impossible next year marks  the release of the now seventh  installment which is being produced back  to back with part eight of course Tom  Cruise will once again Star as Ethan  Hunt and he'll be joined by Simon Pegg  as Benji Rebecca Ferguson as ilsa and  Vanessa Kirby as Alana to name but a few  Henry cerny's Eugene kittridge is also  back in its role after many years as for  the plot hardly any information is  available yet at least there's already  been a first trailer and plenty of  reports about the stunts which are more  or less characteristic at the film  series the main attraction is a  motorcycle stunt and a dizzying height  which is said to be Tom Cruise's most  dangerous stunt to date the director of  the film is again a familiar face namely  Christopher McCrory he has a long  history of working with Tom Cruise and  for example also directs the most  successful film in the series to date  Mission Impossible Fallout we are thus  looking forward to tried and tested  quality for the theatrical release of  Mission Impossible dead reckoning part  1. on July 14 2023 foreign  in the second half of 2023 another movie  from Phase 5 of the MCU awaits we're  talking about the Marvels which unites  Carol Danvers Monica Rambo and Kamala  Khan the crossover movie is set after  the events of One Division and Ms Marvel  there we were already able to observe  Kamala and Carol in a post-credits scene  as they confusingly swap places when  using their superpowers as screenwriter  Bishop K Ali already confirmed in an  interview with deadline the origin of  the mysterious connection between Carol  Kamala and Monica will be revealed in  the film The emphasis will also be on  the more human problems of the three  superheroids Brie Larson's character  will become much more complex and Monica  will also have to find her peace because  she believes Carol abandoned her mother  back then we can also look forward to an  appearance by Samuel L Jackson as Nick  Fury moreover it is considered certain  that the upcoming MCU series secret  Invasion will have some sort of relation  to the Marvels Candyman director Nia  DeCosta who by the way is the youngest  female director ever in the MCU will be  in charge of directing the film The  theatrical release of the Marvels is set  for July July 28 2023  denieville news sequel to 2021's Dune  were released at the end of 2023 after  the previous movie was released under  the premise that it was released in  theaters and on HBO Max at once this  time will almost certainly be a pure  theatrical release returning cast  members include Timothy chalamet as main  character Paula trades Zendaya's Chaney  Rebecca Ferguson as lady Jessica and  Stellan skarsgarders Baron Harkin big  new additions to the cast include  Florence Pugh as Princess erieland and  Christopher Walken who will play the  Fearsome Emperor Chatham IV the movie  will continue to tell Paul's story  focusing on his new life among the  Freeman in addition he must avenge his  family and take on Baron Harkin it while  still reconciling his love for Chaney  the movie is based on Frank Herbert's  novel series dude however it is hard to  tell how much of the book's storyline  director denieville new will incorporate  into the finished film Dune part 2 were  released in cinemas on November 3rd  2023.  just a few days before the end of 2023  we can finally enjoy Aquaman in the lost  kingdom the predecessor set the bar very  high and is regarded as DC's most  successful film with box office takings  of almost 1.15 billion US Dollars the  plot naturally revolves around Arthur  Curry who reluctantly took over as the  king of Atlantis in the first part and  as a result triggered a massive  spectacle exactly where things are  headed from there is not entirely clear  but it will probably become more and  more gloomy as director James Watt has  confirmed several times in the past in  addition to Jason Momoa as Aquaman and  Amber Heard as Mara Yaya Abdul Mateen II  will again embody the villain Black  Manta the latter is still out for  revenge against Aquaman and will try  everything in his power to make the  superheroes life a living hell a first  look at Aquaman's new suit can already  be found on momoa's Instagram account  where by the way it can also be seen  together with Ben Affleck who after many  years makes a comeback as Bruce Wayne  AKA Batman it promises to be exciting to  find out whether the film lives up to  its high expectations Aquaman in the  lost kingdom were released in cinemas on  December 25th 2023  that was our original for the movie  Blockbusters we are most looking forward  to in 2023 are you excited about the  2023 movie year and if so which movie is  already your big highlight feel free to  let us know in the comments if you want  to be regularly updated in the movies  mentioned and many more we suggest you  check out our weekly news format in  which we sum up the most important  Hollywood news for you every week thanks  for watching and see you next time  [Music]  foreign  [Music]
 

